p.Clearer co-op sleep guidance directing players to their assigned bed when a teammate is waiting to sleep.Found a bug? Report it on our Discord. Screenshots, videos, and whether you were playing as the host or a client help us investigate.Thanks for helping us","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T08:13:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067928783","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:50:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3687830-1846018067928226","game_id":"steam-3687830","kind":"announcement","title":"Did it run out of fuel?","summary":"Hey everyone,You can finally get your hands on MULERUN. The free demo is now available on Steam!Start with empty pockets, gather fruit, brew your first batch, and find customers willing to pay for it. Save up for transport, get your deliveries done, and work your way towards your first smuggling flight.Play solo or bring up to three friends. Just think carefully about who gets to fly the plane.I’m making MULERUN on my own, so seeing people finally play it is a big moment for me. I’d love to hear","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-08T03:39:32Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067928226","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:50:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3687830-1845383656389413","game_id":"steam-3687830","kind":"announcement","title":"The Free Mulerun Demo Launches October 7!","summary":"The Free Mulerun Demo Launches October 7!Hey Bootleggers!It’s finally happening: the free demo for Mulerun — Retro Bootlegger Simulator launches on Steam on October 7.I’m developing the game on my own, and a lot of work has gone into getting it to this point. I’m really looking forward to seeing you play it—and honestly, I’m nervous too. Playing your own game every day during development is one thing. Handing it over to people experiencing it for the first time is something else entirely.The CIA","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-03T15:23:34Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656389413","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:50:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3687830-1845383656388439","game_id":"steam-3687830","kind":"announcement","title":"The First Mulerun Trailer Is Here","summary":"The First Mulerun Trailer Is HereAfter almost a year of working on Mulerun, I can finally show you the first trailer.I’ve been developing the game on my own, so a lot of work has gone into getting it to this point. There were plenty of things I had to rebuild, change, or simply start over with along the way, but now the game is finally at a stage where I feel ready to show much more of it.I’m honestly very excited to see what people think.The trailer gives you a first proper look at the game, in","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-03T05:46:16Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656388439","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:50:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3687830-1844751498230628","game_id":"steam-3687830","kind":"announcement","title":"The MULERUN demo is approved. Almost time to let you loose.","summary":"The MULERUN demo is approved. Almost time to let you loose.Hey everyone,A bit of good news: the MULERUN demo has passed Steam’s review and is approved for release.It’s not live just yet, but you won’t have to wait much longer. The next announcement will be the one where I can finally tell you to go and play it.Making this game on my own means I spend a lot of time looking at things that still need work. Seeing that green “Approved for release” bar was a nice moment. I wanted to share it with you","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-28T06:05:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498230628","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:50:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3687830-1843481262696415","game_id":"steam-3687830","kind":"announcement","title":"THIS ISN’T THE TRAILER… BUT WE’RE GETTING CLOSE","summary":"Hey, bootleggers!I’ve just released a short new video — a first glimpse into the story of MULERUN.This is not the official trailer. Not yet.It’s a small taste of how your new life begins: a tropical sunset, a black car, a CIA agent, a pager… and an offer you can’t refuse.The full trailer is getting very close, and I’m excited to show you much more of the island, the bootlegging business, the co-op chaos, and the dangerous runs waiting ahead.If this first glimpse has you curious, the two best way","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-11T20:57:52Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1843481262696415","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:50:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3687830-1842212951314036","game_id":"steam-3687830","kind":"update","title":"Development Update — Preparing for Takeoff","summary":"Development Update — Preparing for TakeoffBootleggers!Development on Mulerun is moving forward, and several major pieces of the game are currently taking shape.Right now, our attention is focused on three connected areas: flight, NPCs, and the in-game tracking system.✈️ Making Flight Feel RightThe plane is more than transportation — it’s one of the most important parts of the Mulerun experience.We’re currently designing and testing how flying should feel, from basic controls and camera behavior ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-01T16:33:01Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951314036","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:50:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3687830-1842212951296212","game_id":"steam-3687830","kind":"announcement","title":"Engines Ready. Still Hot. Trailer Incoming","summary":"Bootleggers!Something has been brewing behind the scenes — and it’s almost ready to come out of the barrel.Very soon, we’ll be releasing a brand-new Mulerun trailer, offering a fresh look at the tropical trouble we’ve been building: chaotic co-op teamwork, moonshine production, risky cargo flights, and an island where every delivery can turn into a getaway.We don’t want to spoil the best moments just yet. Let’s just say the still is hot, the bottles are packed, the engines are coughing to life… ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-26T08:54:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951296212","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:50:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3687830-1841579228670855","game_id":"steam-3687830","kind":"update","title":"Small Development Update","summary":"Small Development UpdateHi everyone!The game is being developed at full speed, and progress is being made every day.I want to emphasize that I am the sole developer behind the project. Programming, design, missions, balancing, testing, bug fixing, and preparing the Steam release are all handled by me. Development can therefore take longer than it would for a full studio, but the game is actively being worked on and has not been abandoned.I’m currently aiming to release the game in Early Access b","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-22T06:17:08Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228670855","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:50:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3687830-1840944183788386","game_id":"steam-3687830","kind":"update","title":"Development Update — Mulerun is Alive and Kicking","summary":"# Development Update — Mulerun is Alive and KickingBootleggers! We know it's been quiet on this page. That silence ends today.Over the past weeks we've rebuilt Mulerun's foundations from the ground up —and we mean the fun kind of \"rebuilt\": the game is now being developed with**4-player online co-op built into its core**, full **controller support**,and **Steam Deck** as a first-class target from day one.What we're working on right now:- A new character system built for multiplayer- The full moo","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-18T10:26:20Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1840944183788386","verified_at":"2026-10-20T11:50:58Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3687830-1828894815567799","game_id":"steam-3687830","kind":"update","title":"Development Update – Big Progress and Exciting News Coming Soon","summary":"Hello everyone! 👋We wanted to share a quick update from the development of MULERUN – Retro Bootlegger Simulator.💻 Development has been moving forward at full speed! Over the past weeks we’ve been working hard on improving core systems, adding new mechanics, and expanding the island experience.🌴 The world of MULERUN is slowly coming together — from the small house and orchard where your story begins, to the systems that will allow your little island hustle to grow into something much bigger.⚙️ Be","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-04-07T15:50:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":